stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NEW: new &lt;burst&gt;
    NEW --> READY: Scheduler add_process()
    
    READY --> RUNNING: dispatch()
    
    RUNNING --> READY: Preemption (Quantum agotado)
    RUNNING --> WAITING: I/O Request o Sync Wait
    RUNNING --> TERMINATED: burst_time == 0
    
    WAITING --> READY: I/O Complete o Resource Ready
    
    TERMINATED --> [*]
    
    note right of RUNNING
        Ejemplo Demo
        T=0: P1,P2,P3 → READY
        T=1: P1 → RUNNING
        T=3: P1 → READY (Q=2)
        T=5: P2 → READY (Q=2)
        T=13: P3 → TERMINATED
    end note
    
